      "content": "the pulsing thing is what's weird though. it's like a steady rhythm right in my belly. if it's just the stones, does that happen? i don't really wanna go to the er if i don't have to, it's always so expensive and the wait is insane. can i just take some ibuprofen and wait it out to see if it goes away?",
